mxCell><mxCell id="v37" value="TR_Fail: Fail&#xa;Fail = CmdAbort OR StepTimeout&#xa;OR NOT AUTEXT_ACT&#xa;(result ABORTED, TIMEOUT or AUTEXT_LOST)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Consolas;fontColor=#202936;fontColor=#B42318;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1395" y="395" width="340" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e38" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202936;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1380" y="612" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1380" y="636" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v39" value="ST_IDLE" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Consolas;fontColor=#202936;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="638" width="140" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v40" value="Bold names under arrows are SFC jumps to that step. At the ST_START divergence the leftmost true transition is taken first (ISPSoft 14.2.3).&#xa;RobotIo computes all outputs, Fail and StepTimeout from step flags X and step time T. StepTimeout (proposed): PREP 5 s, START 30 s, SELECT 2 s.&#xa;The PLC does not supervise the running program: the PC derives running / finished / interrupted from APPL_RUN, PRO_ACT and PGNO_REQ.&#xa;FB_RunSetVar accepts RUN only with AUTEXT_ACT AND IN_HOME AND NOT APPL_RUN, and RESUME only with AUTEXT_ACT AND APPL_RUN AND NOT PRO_ACT. All KUKA outputs are gated by AUTEXT_ACT." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Consolas;fontColor=#202936;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="680" width="1700" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
